SUMMARY:Blood on the Clocktower
DESCRIPTION:BLOOD ON THE CLOCKTOWER SESSION: Wednesday September 9th at 7.3
 0pm ****Tickets will go on sale from midday on Thursday the 6th of August 
 via this page Join us for a new event in the Netherworld – Blood on the 
 Clocktower! There’s been some busy traffic in this clocktower\, so we’
 re now running this event fortnightly\, alternating between Tuesday and Su
 nday evenings. Led by a grimoire wielding host\, each participant will be 
 given a role to play in an interactive social deduction game where death i
 s not the end. Be ready for a night of lies\, mystery and death for up to 
 16 players. Blood in the Clocktower is an Australian made game in the vein
  of Werewolf and Mafia by The Pandemonium Institute. You can check them ou
 t via http://bloodontheclocktower.com // @bloodontheclocktower The session
  happens in the Lost Souls area of Netherworld. Each ticket comes with you
 r first drink and can be grabbed via www.netherworldarcade.com .
LOCATION:Netherworld\, 186 Brunswick Street
URL:https://www.netherworldarcade.com/event/blood-on-the-clocktower-5/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
